<title>NETHERLANDS: BAM H1 PROFIT 0.6 MILLION GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>BAM H1 PROFIT 0.6 MILLION GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>BUNNIK, Netherlands 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>H1 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.31 vs   4.19</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.6  vs   8.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			     726    vs 690   </p>
<p>    Operating profit		    12.2  vs  11.2 </p>
<p>    Associates income	   loss  11.7  vs   1.3 profit</p>
<p>    Tax					0.2  vs   4.3</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Koninklijke BAM Groep NV.</p>
</text>
